    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragon Khan</i></strong> is a third-person action RPG set in the exotic world of Ithannar, where players take on the role of Botu, a hybrid of dragon and human, as he must master ancient martial arts and harness the magic that flows through the land.<br><br>Botu must explore vast wildernesses, uncover ancient ruins and temples, and face relentless enemies in fast-paced and strategic combat that combines physical prowess with magical abilities. The immersive story and emotional depth of <i>Dragon Khan</i> will draw players into a rich narrative, while the impactful and satisfying combat experience aims to give them the sense of power and control. With its stunning environments, fluid gameplay, and a world steeped in both mystery and danger, <i>Dragon Khan</i> promises a captivating adventure that is as thrilling as it is emotional.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragon Khan</i></strong> is a third-person action RPG set in the exotic world of Ithannar, where players take on the role of Botu, a hybrid of dragon and human, as he must master ancient martial arts and harness the magic that flows through the land.<br><br>Botu must explore vast wildernesses, uncover ancient ruins and temples, and face relentless enemies in fast-paced and strategic combat that combines physical prowess with magical abilities. The immersive story and emotional depth of <i>Dragon Khan</i> will draw players into a rich narrative, while the impactful and satisfying combat experience aims to give them the sense of power and control. With its stunning environments, fluid gameplay, and a world steeped in both mystery and danger, <i>Dragon Khan</i> promises a captivating adventure that is as thrilling as it is emotional.</p>",
